#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:4
msgid "VDI Allocations"
msgstr "VDI Allocations"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:9
msgid ""
"VDI Allocations represent the assignment of a VDI Pool instance to a "
"specific user. When a user requests a virtual desktop session, |morpheus|"
" creates an allocation that binds an available Instance from the pool to "
"that user for the duration of their session (non-persistent pools) or "
"indefinitely (persistent pools)."
msgstr ""
"VDI Allocations represent el assignment de un VDI Pool instance a un "
"específico usuario. Cuando un usuario solicitudes un escritorio virtual "
"session, |morpheus| crea un allocation ese binds un disponible Instancia "
"desde el pool a ese usuario para el duration de su session (non-"
"persistente pools) o indefinitely (persistente pools)."

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:11
msgid ""
"Allocations are managed automatically by |morpheus| but can be monitored "
"and manually managed by administrators."
msgstr ""
"Allocations son administrado automáticamente por |morpheus| pero puede be"
" monitored y manualmente administrado por administrators."

