#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:113
msgid ""
"**Non-persistent pools:** Recommended timeout of ~10 minutes. After "
"expiry, the VM is destroyed."
msgstr ""
"**Non-persistent pools:** Recommended timeout de ~10 minutes. Después de "
"expiry, el VM es destroyed."

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:114
msgid ""
"**Persistent pools:** Recommended timeout of ~1 hour. After expiry, the "
"VM is shut down."
msgstr ""
"**Persistent pools:** Recommended timeout de ~1 hour. Después de expiry, "
"el VM es shut down."

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:116
msgid "Important"
msgstr "Importante"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:116
msgid ""
"Lease timeouts auto-extend for as long as the user is logged into or "
"browsing any area of the |morpheus| application. Once the user closes "
"their browser or logs out, timeouts stop auto-extending."
msgstr ""
"Lease timeouts auto-extend para como largo como el usuario es logged en o"
" browsing cualquier area del |morpheus| aplicación. Once el usuario "
"closes su browser o registros out, timeouts detener auto-extending."

