#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:161
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Solución de problemas"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:163
msgid ""
"**Allocation stuck in \"preparing\":** Check the Instance provisioning "
"status in ``Provisioning > Instances``. The underlying VM may have failed"
" to provision."
msgstr ""
"**Allocation stuck in \"preparing\":** Verificar el Instancia "
"provisioning estado en ``Provisioning > Instances``. El underlying VM "
"puede tienen falló a provision."

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:164
msgid ""
"**Allocation stuck in \"releasing\":** The Instance destruction may be "
"failing. Check cloud connectivity and VM power state."
msgstr ""
"**Allocation stuck in \"releasing\":** El Instancia destruction puede be "
"failing. Verificar cloud connectivity y VM power estado."

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:165
msgid ""
"**No available allocations:** Pool may be at maximum capacity or minimum "
"idle threshold is set too low for demand."
msgstr ""
"**No available allocations:** Pool puede be en máximo capacidad o mínimo "
"idle threshold es establecer too bajo para demand."

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:166
msgid ""
"**User cannot connect:** Verify the allocation status is \"reserved\" and"
" the Instance is powered on. Check Guacamole connectivity."
msgstr ""
"**Usuario cannot connect:** Verificar el allocation estado es "
"\"reserved\" y el Instancia es powered en. Verificar Guacamole "
"connectivity."

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:167
msgid ""
"**Persistent allocation not preserving data:** Ensure the pool type is "
"set to Persistent and the Instance is shutting down (not being "
"destroyed)."
msgstr ""
"**Persistent allocation not preserving data:** Asegurar el pool tipo es "
"establecer a Persistente y el Instancia es shutting down (no being "
"destroyed)."

